(
    title: "Dig Dug",
    description: Some("Dig tunnels through four layers of dirt, stunning the balloon-like Pookas and fire-breathing Fygars with the pump and inflating them until they burst — or undermine a boulder to crush a chain of them at once for the big scores. Both meanies can turn into ghosts that drift through undug ground, a vegetable prize surfaces each round at your starting shaft to be covered before it vanishes, and the Easy variation — marked by a teddy-bear head in the score — repeats one gentle round forever."),
